# Hell to Pay: excess damage is what is dealt above lethal damage given damage already marked (CR 120.10, 704.5g). A Shock leaves Bot2's Hill Giant (3/3) with 2 damage, so lethal
# damage is now 1: Hell to Pay with X = 2 deals 1 lethal and 1 excess and makes exactly one tapped Treasure.
